## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-5.4 Pro
- **Short description:** OpenAI’s GPT-5.4 Pro is a higher-compute Responses-only model variant designed for tougher problems, offering extended reasoning at premium pricing with a 1M-class context window.
- **Provider / access:** OpenAI API via Responses API as `gpt-5.4-pro` (Chat Completions not supported per developer docs). Local metadata lists `opencode/gpt-5.4-pro` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Developer docs list snapshot `gpt-5.4-pro-2026-03-05` and knowledge cutoff August 31, 2025.
- **IDs:** `gpt-5.4-pro`, `gpt-5.4-pro-2026-03-05`.
- **Context window:** 1,050,000 context window; 128,000 max output tokens (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output (OpenAI developer docs).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $30 / 1M input tokens, $180 / 1M output tokens (OpenAI developer docs). Long-context (>272K) pricing multipliers apply per docs.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary OpenAI model; architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

